			"notes": "New additions from 1.0.4:\n\n- Added a chance to resist dying on death's door as a configurable option\n- Adjusted hotbar broadcast to have a configurable \"range of broadcast\"\n- Added the ability to have hotbar broadcast messages be sent in global chat as a configurable option\n- Added an option to enable \"totem mode\". This stops normal operation of the mod, instead changing the behavior of totems to be that of the mod in its regular state (see #6)\n- Added further configurability to sounds (volume, pitch and whether other players can hear it).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ev-ev/DeathsDoor/compare/v1.0.4...v1.0.5"
